  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DAN 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nebukadinesaro okorua ogochika ng’a kera omonto asasime omogwekano oroisetigwe korwa ase etaabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebukadinesaro omorwoti akaroisia omogwekano korwa ase etaabu; obotambe bw’omogwekano oria nigo bwarenge obw’amaboko emerongo etano nomo, na obogare bwaye obw’amaboko atano na rimo; akayotenenia ase ense omweya ya Dura, agwo ase orogongo rwa Babiloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio omorwoti Nebukadinesaro agatoma abanto basangererie amo abagaambi abanene b’oborwoti bwaye, na abagaambi be chingongo chiaye, na abagabana, na abasemia, na abagachi be chikungo, na abagaambi ebiina, na abamanyi b’amachiiko, na abanene bande bonsi b’oborwoti bwaye. Abwo bonsi nigo barangereretigwe ase ogwatanana na gosesenia omogwekano oria Nebukadinesaro omorwoti konya atenenirie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abagaambi baria abanene, na abagaambi be chingongo, na abagabana, na abasemia, na abagachi be chikungo, na abagaambi ebiina, na abamanyi b’amachiiko, na abanene bande bonsi b’ense eria, bagaacha gwatanana na gosesenia omogwekano oria omorwoti Nebukadinesaro konya atenenirie. Ekero bateneine bosio bw’omogwekano oria,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omoraria agaaka eriogi rinene, akabora, “Inwe abanto b’ebisaku bionsi, na ab’emenwa yonsi, mwachiikirwe",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng’a ekero moraigwe eriogi ri’ebitureri, na ebiroria, na amakano ao ao, na amarandi, na amariogi a kera egento ki’amatera, goika motung’ame inse, mosasiime omogwekano bw’etaabu, oria Nebukadinesaro omorwoti atenenirie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto onde bwensi otatung’ameti na koumama ase okoyosasiima, erio agwo kegima oyio narutwe ase eriko ri’omorero ekebemberi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio ekero abanto b’ebisaku bionsi na ab’emenwa yonsi baigwete eriogi ri’ebitureri, na ebiroria, na amakano ao ao, na amariogi a kera egento ki’amatera, bonsi bakaba bagatung’ama na gosasiima omogwekano bw’etaabu, oria omorwoti konya atenenetie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abasani baria batato ba Danieli bagosoerwa ase ogotaigwera",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono abanto bande b’Abakalidayo bakagenda bagasoera Abayahudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagakwana, bagateebia Nebukadinesaro omorwoti, “Aye omorwoti, ochie kare!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye omorwoti nigo kwarua ogochika ng’a kera omonto okoigwa eriogi ri’ebitureri, na ebiroria, na amakano ao ao, na amarandi, na amariogi a kera egento ki’amatera, goika atung’ame inse na gosasiima omogwekano oria bw’etaabu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naende ng’a omonto onde bwensi otatung’ameti inse na koumama ase okoyosasiima, oyio goika arutwe ase eriko ri’omorero ekebemberi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono mbare aa abanto bande b’Abayahudi abwo gwachorete gotenenera amang’ana ’orogongo oro rwa Babiloni: Sadaraka, na Meshaka, na Abedi‐Nego. Aye omorwoti, abanto aba bachaayire amachiiko ao; barabwo tibari gokorera chinyasae chiao gose gotung’ama na koumama ase ogosasiima omogwekano oria bw’etaabu aye gwatenenetie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio omorwoti Nebukadinesaro akaba nekeririanda egetindi, agachiika ng’a Sadaraka, na Meshaka, na Abedi‐Nego, barentwe ase are, na abamura baria batato bakarentwa ase obosio bwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebukadinesaro akababoria, “Inwe Sadaraka, na Meshaka, na Abedi‐Nego, Inee, nekeene ng’a inwe timori gokorera chinyasae chiane, gose timori gosasiima omogwekano oria bw’etaabu ntenenetie?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono mobe ang’e, ekero moraigwe eriogi ri’ebitureri, na ebiroria, na amakano ao ao, na amarandi, na amariogi a kera egento ki’amatera motung’ame inse moumame ase ogosasiima omogwekano oria naroisirie, ayio naro arabe buya ase more; korende onye timokoyosasiima, rirorio agwo kegima goika morutwe ase eriko ri’omorero ekebemberi. Inee! Nenyasae ereri eranyare kobatooria korwa ase amaboko ane?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Sadaraka, na Meshaka, na Abedi‐Nego, bakairaneria omorwoti oria, bakamoteebia, “Aye Nebukadinesaro, titoganeti gokoiraneria igoro y’amang’ana aya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye omorwoti, Nyasae oito, oria togokorera, nanyare gototooria korwa ase eriko ri’omorero ekebemberi, na korwa ase amaboko ao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende nonya tagochia gototooria korwa ase ore aye omorwoti, goika omanye ng’a intwe titogwancha gokorera chinyasae chiao, gose gosasiima omogwekano bw’etaabu, oyio gwatenenetie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abasani baria batato ba Danieli bakonacherwa ekiina ki’ogokwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Nebukadinesaro agaichorwa nekeririanda, na obosio bwaye bokaonchoka igoro ya Sadaraka, na Meshaka, na Abedi‐Nego. Agachiika ng’a omorero bw’eriko riria omentwe obe omonene ara gatano na kabere kobua oyo o botambe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agachiika abarwani esegi barenge ne chinguru basibe Sadaraka, na Meshaka, na Abedi‐Nego, baabarute ime ase eriko riria ri’omorero ekebemberi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio abamura baria batato bagasibwa bare ne chisirwari chiabo, ne chiganchwa chiabo, na emiambaro yabo, ne chianga chinde, bakarutwa ase eriko riria ri’omorero ekebemberi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono ekiagera ogochika kw’omorwoti kwarenge ogotindi, na ase ayio omorero bw’eriko riria konya omentirwe obeire omonene mono, chimeme chi’omorero oria chigasamba na goita abanto baria barutete Sadaraka, na Meshaka, na Abedi‐Nego, ase omorero oria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto baria batato: Sadaraka, na Meshaka, na Abedi‐Nego, bakagwa ase eriko riria ri’omorero ekebemberi basibire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Nebukadinesaro omorwoti agakumia na goichana, agatenena ase obwango, akaboria abasemia baye, “Inee! Titwarutete abanto batato boka ase omorero basibire?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bakamoiraneria, “Ee, aye omorwoti, ayio namaene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti akabairaneria, akabateebia, “Na bono nindoche abanto baane basiboire, bagotaara ime ase omorero, na barabwo tibayieti aande nonya ng’ake; omonto oria o kane nigo akororekana buna omwana bw’enyasae.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abanto baria batato bagosiborwa na koegwa obonene",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio Nebukadinesaro akagenda ang’e nomonwa bw’eriko riria ri’omorero ekebemberi, agaaka eriogi, akarangeria, “Sadaraka, na Meshaka, na Abedi‐Nego, inwe abasomba ba Nyasae Ore Igoro Mono, soka korwa ime agwo, moche aiga!” Erio Sadaraka, na Meshaka, na Abedi‐Nego, bagasoka korwa ase omorero oria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abagaambi abanene b’oborwoti, na abagaambi be chingongo, na abagabana, na abaseemia b’omorwoti bagasangererekana amo, bakarora ng’a omorero oria torenge nokobua konde gwonsi igoro ase emebere y’ abanto baria; chitukia chi’emetwe yabo tichiarurogete, ne chianga chiabo tichiayiete, gose tibatiogete rimisu ri’omorero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
