        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Nebukadinesaro agaaka eriogi, agateeba, “Atogigwe Nyasae o Sadaraka, na o Meshaka, na bw’Abedi‐Nego, oyio otomire omomalaika oye gotooria abasomba baye abwo bamosemeretie na bangete koigwera ogochika kwane inche omorwoti, bakarua emebere yabo esire kobua gokorera na gosasiima enyasae ende yonsi, otatiga Nyasae obo bweka.",
          "type": "text",
