        {
          "text": "“Bono narure ogochika ng’a omonto onde bwensi bw’egesaku kende gionsi, gose bw’omonwa onde bwensi, orakwane mamincha ya Nyasae o Sadaraka, na o Meshaka, na bw’Abedi‐Nego, oyio nabutoranwe ekiimo ase ekiimo, na enyomba yaye netagorwe ebe rituuri, ekiagera enyasae ende teri eranyare gotooria ase enchera buna eye.”",
          "type": "text",
